# Abyssal Harvester: "Create a token that's a copy of it, except it's a Nightmare in addition to its other types" (CR 707.9b). The only
# exception is the Nightmare type: a copy of a legendary creature card is legendary too (the rulings: "the token ... copies exactly what was
# printed on the original card"). Bot1 casts the Harvester on turn 1; on turn 3 it casts Zul Ashur, Lich Lord (legendary, with ward)
# and kills it with its own Lightning Bolt, then taps the Harvester for the Zul Ashur card in its graveyard: the token has Zul Ashur's
# name, is a legendary Nightmare Zombie Warlock, and the Harvester is tapped (the {T} paid), so it cannot be used again that turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Abyssal Harvester
Zul Ashur, Lich Lord
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

