Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Zul Ashur, Lich Lord)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Zul Ashur, Lich Lord; Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Abyssal Harvester.Activate(Bot1.Graveyard.Zul Ashur, Lich Lord)
? Bot1.Battlefield.Abyssal Harvester.Tapped = true
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
